Description: OnePlus Pad 2 Pro kernel and modules @KERNEL_RELEASE@
 Contains matching, signed boot images and the complete configured module
 tree. Standard kmod indices support module dependencies and modalias loading.
 Installing this payload only installs files and refreshes module indices;
 it does not select a boot image or write boot partitions. The erhai-kernel
 selector activates it when ready. Previous payloads remain for rollback.
